look glass
# NOTE: sandbox accent colour in Glass differed (Rust red-coral vs QML orange) in earlier results; that is a known FAIL, report if still so.
# NOTE: click on layer surfaces may not register in the harness
ipc panels open spotlight TESSERA-TEST
wait 1
key 7*6
wait 1
shot ac-76
note Answer card with orange tile, big "42", caption "Enter copies it"; tile colour must be orange as in QML.
key -k Return
wait 1
setup sh -c 'wl-paste > /tmp/ac-clip.txt; cat /tmp/ac-clip.txt'
shot ac-closed
note Search is closed after Return; clipboard holds 42 (checked by the setup line).
ipc panels open spotlight TESSERA-TEST
wait 1
key 10 km in miles
wait 2
shot ac-conv
note Card with a green tile once the conversion arrives (needs network/conversion; if only a plain result shows, mark unverifiable).
# hover card with another row selected
key -M ctrl -k a -m ctrl
key -k BackSpace
key 7*6
wait 1
key -k Down
wait 1
ptr move 960 322 sleep 300 glide 960 322 300
wait 1
shot ac-hover
note Answer card hovered while another row is selected: fillHover faded in (150 ms), no accent tint.
key -k Up
wait 1
shot ac-selected
note Card selected: accent tint plus border, same as QML.
key -k Escape
